<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -United Dominion Realty cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -United Dominion Realty cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said on Wendesday it lowered its rating on the shares of United Dominion Realty Trust Inc to buy from a strong buy.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares of United Dominion gained 1/16 to 14-71/6.</p>
